{"type":"form","data":{"fields":[{"id":"html-NaN","element_id":"html-NaN","form_id":"wrapper-4954-9627","parent_group":"","type":"html","options":[],"cols":"12","conditions":[],"wrapper_id":"wrapper-4954-9627","field_label":"","variations":"<p>The application covers your contact details, exhibition preferences, artwork description, and supporting materials. You will be asked for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your exhibition choice, venue address and supporting details</li>\n<li>Your contact details</li>\n<li>An artist summary - describing the work you wish to show, including medium and subject matter (no more than 200 characters, approximately 35 words)</li>\n<li>An artist statement - providing more detailed explanation of your artist practice, including materials used and processes (no more than 1000 characters, approximately 160 words)</li>\n<li>(For Art in Shops' submissions) - provide a description of how your proposal relates to this year’s festival subject title, as detailed within the guidance information (no more than 1000 characters, approximately 160 words)</li>\n<li>Details of additional events (type, date/time, description)</li>\n<li>5 high-quality images (jpg or png only, sized to 1500 pixels at their widest point. See note below.)</li>\n<li>A personal CV (upload as pdf or Word doc)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please read the <a href=\"https://artwalkprojects.co.uk/art-walk-weekends/guidance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">guidance information</a> and <a href=\"https://artwalkprojects.co.uk/art-walk-weekends/terms-and-conditions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Terms and Conditions</a> before beginning your submission.</p>\n<p class=\"form-highlight-box\">If you need help to prepare your images, please try our <strong><a href=\"https://art-walk-img-prep.netlify.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Image Prep Tool</a></strong> <em>(opens in a new window)</em>. This tool will resize and name your images, ready for submission.</p>"},{"id":"group-2","element_id":"gro