rm-highlight-box\">\n<ul style=\"margin: 0;padding-left: 1.5rem\">\n<li>Please note we cannot guarantee placement with your first venue of choice. We aim to match artists to appropriate venues based on the type of work proposed, once we have selected all artists.</li>\n<li>Two artist awards will be offered to selected artists applying through our Art in Shops strand (offering £800 per artist to support the making of new work).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","wrapper_id":"wrapper-1376-9474","conditions":[]},{"id":"page-break-4","element_id":"page-break-4","form_id":"wrapper-1019-6980","parent_group":"","type":"page-break","options":[],"cols":"12","conditions":[],"wrapper_id":"wrapper-1019-6980","btn_left":"« Previous Step","btn_right":"Next Step »","formid":"wrapper-5889-8378"},{"id":"html-third-person-notice","element_id":"html-third-person-notice","form_id":"wrapper-9420-7181","parent_group":"","type":"html","cols":"12","variations":"<p class=\"form-highlight-box\">Please write in third person ONLY (do not use 'I')</p>","wrapper_id":"wrapper-9420-7181","conditions":[]},{"id":"textarea-4","element_id":"textarea-4","form_id":"wrapper-1800-2485","parent_group":"","type":"textarea","cols":"12","field_label":"Artist Summary","placeholder":"","description":"Text provided here will form your entry on the website and printed map. Please provide a brief description of the work you will be showing, detailing the medium and subject matter. Max 200 characters.","required":"true","required_message":"Please provide an artist summary.","limit":"200","limit_type":"characters","wrapper_id":"wrapper-1800-2485","conditions":[]},{"id":"textarea-5","element_id":"textarea-5","form_id":"wrapper-8502-7864","parent_group":"","type":"textarea","cols":"12","field_label":"Artist Statement","placeholder":"","description":"Please expand in more detail on your current artistic practice describing your subject matter, themes, materials used or processes of working along with information about recent exhibitions or education, of most relevancy to your planned exhibition. If applying as one collective, please include here all the names of those exhibiting in the collective. Max 1000 characters.","required":"true","required_message":"Please provide an artist statement.","limit":"1000","limit_type":"characters","wrapper_id":"wrapper-8502-7864","conditions":[]},{"id":"page-break-3","element_id":"page-break-3","form_id":"wrapper-6954-5104","parent_group":"","type":"page-break","options":[],"cols":"12","conditions":[],"wrapper_id":"wrapper-6954-5104","btn_left":"« Previous Step","btn_right":"Next Step »","formid":"wrapper-6771-2460"},{"id":"radio-6","element_id":"radio-6","form_id":"wrapper-6394-1053","parent_group":"","type":"radio","options":[{"label":"Yes","value":"one","key":"9449-9446","error":""},{"label":"No","value":"two","key":"4541-5717","error":""}],"cols":"12","conditions":[],"wrapper_id":"wrapper-6394-1053","hidden_behavior":"zero","value_type":"radio","field_label":"Are you putting on any additional event(s)?","layout":"horizontal","options_bulk_editor":"Yes;one; 0\nNo;two; 0","required":"1","description":"If you have an additional event (talk, demonstration, workshop etc) you would like to run alongside your exhibition, please include it here. This is open to all artists whether you are applying as an Art House or Art in Shops’ participant. We will be in touch to finalise details before going to print."},{"id":"select-1","element_id":"select-1","form_id":"wrapper-4031-2483","parent_group":"","type":"select","cols":"12","field_label":"Type of event","placeholder":"-- Select if applicable --","description":"","required":"false","required_message":"Please select an event type.","options":[{"label":"Workshop","value":"workshop","default":"","error":""},{"label":"Demo","value":"demo","default":"","error":""},{"label":"Talk","value":"talk","default":"","error":""},{"label":"Performance","value":"performance","default":"","error":""},{"label":"Walk","value":"walk","