llest point.</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0\">Before uploading, please save images with your own name so that we can easily identify them as your work.</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0\">Accepted formats are jpeg or png only. No tifs, psds or gifs will be accepted.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-highlight-box\">\n<p>If you need help to prepare your images, please try our <strong><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://art-walk-img-prep.netlify.app/\">Image Prep Tool</a></strong> <em>(opens in a new window)</em>. This tool will resize and name your images, ready for submission.</p>\n</div>","wrapper_id":"wrapper-3547-9633","conditions":[]},{"id":"upload-1","element_id":"upload-1","form_id":"wrapper-5683-5169","parent_group":"","type":"upload","cols":"12","field_label":"Upload images (5 required)","description":"Max 3MB per image","required":"true","required_message":"Please upload your images.","file-limit":"custom","file-type":"multiple","filetypes":["jpg","jpeg","png","jpg|jpeg|jpe"],"custom-filetypes":"","file-size":"10","wrapper_id":"wrapper-5683-5169","conditions":[],"custom-files":"1","upload-limit":"3","use_library":"true","upload-method":"submission"},{"id":"html-cv-info","element_id":"html-cv-info","form_id":"wrapper-8213-7427","parent_group":"","type":"html","cols":"12","variations":"<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Recent CV</h3>\n<p>Please upload a recent CV (no more than 2 pages in length) that details your education, recent exhibitions, awards &amp; commissions (Pdf or Word doc). The CV is used only for selection purposes. It will not be included as part of your web listing.</p>","wrapper_id":"wrapper-8213-7427","conditions":[]},{"id":"upload-2","element_id":"upload-2","form_id":"wrapper-9730-1532","parent_group":"","type":"upload","cols":"12","field_label":"Upload CV","description":"Max 5MB per document.","required":"1","required_message":"Please upload your CV.","file-limit":"1","file-type":"single","filetypes":["pdf","doc",